      "note": "Transferred unchanged from 232Th19F+ to 229Th19F+; not measured for the target isotope and not mass-scaled. Source-isotope uncertainty: 0.1 MHz; target-isotope transfer uncertainty is unquantified. may absorb 2 c_I .. 6 c_I ~ 40-120 kHz of unmodelled nuclear spin-rotation -- [HAM] S2.6, OPEN-6"
